, "capability_id": "RMR-CAP-L03-M04", "source_record": "Existing runoff report findings and identified missing conditions.", "limitation": "Missing slope or rainfall controls must be made explicit.", "drive_folder": "https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/164RmadDVl2l0_WfbugnAObWoTB34Xx1Z", "source": "RAREMINDS River Mission Grades 6-10, approved module and 6E content stored in linked Google Drive assets; career role labels are for exploration, not certification"}'::jsonb)
