: 4, "capability_id": "RMR-CAP-L04-M03", "source_record": "Mock B-PRE tare 32.10 g/final 37.00 g; B-POST tare 31.60 g/final 36.45 g.", "limitation": "No supported salt-removal percentage without comparable aliquots and controls.", "drive_folder": "https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1nD8QAFL-qeJpj9WWGa6FdULaNk1cWOiH", "source": "RAREMINDS River Mission Grades 6-10, approved module and 6E content stored in linked Google Drive assets; career role labels are for exploration, not certification"}'::jsonb)
