apability_id": "RMR-CAP-L05-M02", "source_record": "Separate mock PH-07 meter QC evidence, distinct from the R-26 sample report.", "limitation": "Do not treat mock QC as a verified reading from a physical meter.", "drive_folder": "https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1DoTTtDthk_qA3QpJ8ejDp3pq4MmmH63B", "source": "RAREMINDS River Mission Grades 6-10, approved module and 6E content stored in linked Google Drive assets; career role labels are for exploration, not certification"}'::jsonb)
